WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:03.300
Your health has a history.

2
00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:05.600
But today it lives in pieces:

3
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:08.400
reports in a drawer, results in an inbox,

4
00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:10.100
prescriptions in a photo roll.

5
00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:12.200
AneviaONE brings it together.

6
00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:15.300
Start with a report you already have.

7
00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:18.000
Upload a PDF, take a photo,

8
00:00:18.100 --> 00:00:21.800
or share it straight from WhatsApp or Gmail.

9
00:00:22.400 --> 00:00:25.600
Your original is always kept.

10
00:00:26.400 --> 00:00:29.600
With your permission, AneviaONE reads it,

11
00:00:29.700 --> 00:00:34.500
and turns dates, results and units into clear, organised information.

12
00:00:34.900 --> 00:00:38.500
Every result links back to the page it came from.

13
00:00:38.700 --> 00:00:41.900
Anything uncertain is held for you to confirm.

14
00:00:42.400 --> 00:00:45.300
Each report joins one timeline.

15
00:00:45.600 --> 00:00:50.100
The same test is connected across documents and years,

16
00:00:50.300 --> 00:00:53.600
so your history grows with you.

17
00:00:54.400 --> 00:00:58.200
See what changed since your last report,

18
00:00:58.500 --> 00:01:03.600
and how each measure is moving over time.

19
00:01:04.400 --> 00:01:08.500
Before an appointment, open For Doctor.

20
00:01:08.900 --> 00:01:15.500
A clear one-page summary of your history, ready to share.

21
00:01:16.400 --> 00:01:18.800
And you’re not alone in this.

22
00:01:19.000 --> 00:01:22.900
Keep records for a parent or a child you care for.

23
00:01:23.100 --> 00:01:26.600
Or invite an adult relative to share theirs.

24
00:01:26.900 --> 00:01:31.600
They approve every request, and can withdraw access at any time.

25
00:01:32.400 --> 00:01:35.500
Your health information belongs to you.

26
00:01:35.800 --> 00:01:41.400
Delete a report, or your entire account, whenever you choose.

27
00:01:42.600 --> 00:01:46.000
AneviaONE. Every record. Every change.

28
00:01:46.200 --> 00:01:49.600
One intelligent health history.
